WEBVTT

01:26.580 --> 01:29.780
[Glory]

01:30.600 --> 01:32.880
[Episode 27]

01:32.950 --> 01:36.900
[Linji Prefectural Office]

01:50.600 --> 01:53.200
My Lord, why did you
summon me back so urgently?

01:56.130 --> 01:57.190
Take a look at this.

02:00.870 --> 02:02.930
A reward notice from the Rong family.

02:03.350 --> 02:04.680
Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku

02:04.790 --> 02:06.350
is a rare and valuable book
printed during the Song dynasty.

02:06.350 --> 02:07.040
Rong Shanbao

02:07.040 --> 02:09.970
likely wants to use it
to please the Empress Dowager.

02:10.210 --> 02:11.210
What do you think?

02:12.660 --> 02:13.870
My Lord, if you trust me,

02:13.870 --> 02:14.600
please leave

02:15.350 --> 02:16.350
this matter to me.

02:18.430 --> 02:19.430
What's your plan?

02:21.430 --> 02:23.030
Please wait and see, My Lord.

02:23.840 --> 02:25.440
I will make sure Rong Shanbao

02:26.360 --> 02:27.560
falls into the abyss.

02:32.480 --> 02:33.890
These days, with all
that's happening at the Rong family,

02:33.890 --> 02:35.550
everyone is feeling anxious.

02:35.680 --> 02:36.190
I can see they

02:36.190 --> 02:38.560
have completely lost
interest in processing tea.

02:38.560 --> 02:39.500
They've even ruined

02:39.500 --> 02:40.930
many freshly picked tea leaves.

02:40.930 --> 02:43.329
We might as well
let them rest for a few days.

02:43.800 --> 02:44.530
That's fine.

02:46.360 --> 02:46.910
Shanbao.

02:47.430 --> 02:48.800
Do you know who

02:48.800 --> 02:50.800
is behind the attacks on our family?

02:51.990 --> 02:54.360
Naturally, it's someone who despises
the Rong family the most.

02:54.360 --> 02:55.690
After all, a few days ago

02:55.960 --> 02:57.240
he was just at our tea plantation

02:57.240 --> 02:58.240
where he lost face

02:58.630 --> 03:00.090
and lost his trusted aide.

03:00.870 --> 03:01.390
Him?

03:04.030 --> 03:05.150
How could he possibly control

03:05.150 --> 03:06.480
people from our family?

03:08.520 --> 03:09.320
Lady Shanbao!

03:10.370 --> 03:11.530
Someone has responded to the reward notice

03:11.530 --> 03:12.530
and has come here.

03:14.710 --> 03:16.310
Be more vigilant these days.

03:16.690 --> 03:18.370
Jiang Yiqian has ill intentions.

03:18.370 --> 03:19.660
He definitely won't spare

03:19.660 --> 03:21.660
this place where he was humiliated.

03:21.800 --> 03:22.600
I understand.

03:24.210 --> 03:25.270
Please show him in.

03:26.430 --> 03:27.360
Come in, please.

03:39.110 --> 03:40.170
Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku

03:40.560 --> 03:41.820
is in your possession?

03:42.150 --> 03:42.950
Lady Shanbao.

03:43.610 --> 03:45.190
I escaped
from the Wei family years ago

03:45.190 --> 03:47.000
and have been hiding all these years.

03:47.000 --> 03:48.590
Now I'm too ashamed to go back.

03:48.590 --> 03:50.550
Please keep this matter confidential.

03:50.550 --> 03:51.570
Don't tell the Wei family

03:51.570 --> 03:52.829
about my whereabouts.

03:53.120 --> 03:53.590
I'm only here for

03:53.590 --> 03:55.050
the "Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku."

03:55.310 --> 03:56.930
Other matters don't concern me.

03:56.930 --> 03:58.390
I certainly won't gossip.

03:59.870 --> 04:01.020
In the reward notice,

04:01.020 --> 04:02.900
the Rong family promised one condition.

04:02.900 --> 04:04.430
Is it truly anything I want?

04:04.840 --> 04:06.680
If the Rong family can fulfill it,

04:06.680 --> 04:07.630
we will see to it.

04:09.150 --> 04:09.630
Good.

04:10.400 --> 04:11.430
Please follow me.

04:15.240 --> 04:16.640
Miss, please have a seat.

04:17.829 --> 04:19.430
I've put the book in the inner room.

04:19.430 --> 04:20.269
Please, Miss,

04:20.560 --> 04:22.019
write the agreement first

04:22.250 --> 04:23.950
and I'll go inside to get it for you.

04:23.950 --> 04:24.480
Alright.

04:47.870 --> 04:48.460
My Lady.

04:49.600 --> 04:51.260
Go report to the authorities.

05:14.620 --> 05:15.480
Wei!

05:16.610 --> 05:18.040
Wei, look.

05:18.460 --> 05:20.460
I've brewed a new pot of wine for you.

05:26.830 --> 05:27.390
Wei.

05:28.790 --> 05:29.320
Wei?

05:39.620 --> 05:40.210
Something's wrong!

05:40.210 --> 05:41.480
Murder!

05:41.500 --> 05:43.500
Murder!

05:51.040 --> 05:52.040
My Lord, bad news!

05:52.159 --> 05:54.220
Lady Rong Shanbao has been captured.

06:00.830 --> 06:02.460
Is your leg feeling better, Old Madam?

06:02.460 --> 06:04.070
I still can't get out of bed,

06:04.700 --> 06:06.410
though I can move a little bit.

06:06.740 --> 06:07.600
Your condition

06:08.290 --> 06:10.110
naturally requires gradual recovery.

06:10.110 --> 06:10.920
Given time,

06:11.540 --> 06:13.970
you will surely return
to your former health, Old Madam.

06:13.970 --> 06:15.830
After lying here for so many days,

06:16.430 --> 06:17.160
you're the only one

06:17.160 --> 06:19.160
who comes to see me from time to time.

06:19.310 --> 06:20.820
That ungrateful girl

06:22.030 --> 06:24.430
is probably still holding
a grudge against me.

06:24.430 --> 06:26.430
She hasn't shown her face even once.

06:28.150 --> 06:30.510
What lasting grudge could exist
between grandmother and granddaughter?

06:30.510 --> 06:31.110
Old Madam,

06:31.850 --> 06:33.510
the most important thing for you now

06:33.510 --> 06:34.570
is to rest quietly.

06:35.159 --> 06:36.190
The household matters

06:36.190 --> 06:38.190
will be handled by the young ladies.

06:39.460 --> 06:40.970
Why do I feel

06:41.830 --> 06:43.290
that recently the mansion

06:43.690 --> 06:45.430
seems much quieter?

06:54.560 --> 06:55.620
What's the matter?

06:57.110 --> 06:57.909
It's nothing.

06:58.390 --> 06:59.990
Just some personal affairs.

07:00.080 --> 07:01.540
I should take my leave now.

07:02.090 --> 07:04.220
I'll visit you another day, Old Madam.

07:15.310 --> 07:16.510
You heard correctly?

07:16.630 --> 07:17.750
Lady Shanbao has killed someone?

07:17.750 --> 07:18.650
There's no mistake.

07:18.650 --> 07:20.040
Someone has identified her.

07:20.040 --> 07:22.040
It's already been brought to court.

07:24.330 --> 07:26.220
[Linji Prefectural Office]

07:25.560 --> 07:26.070
My Lord.

07:26.480 --> 07:29.720
I am a neighbor of Wei Zhou.

07:30.270 --> 07:30.870
I saw

07:31.120 --> 07:32.390
the three of them enter the house.

07:32.390 --> 07:33.250
Shortly after,

07:33.390 --> 07:35.190
Lady Shanbao's maid

07:35.360 --> 07:37.090
suddenly rushed out in a hurry.

07:37.250 --> 07:38.180
I never expected

07:38.560 --> 07:39.920
to walk into the room

07:40.430 --> 07:42.510
and find my neighbor

07:42.530 --> 07:43.890
lying on the floor,

07:44.000 --> 07:46.360
his head covered in blood.

07:47.480 --> 07:49.120
Are you certain you only saw

07:49.120 --> 07:50.720
Miss Rong and her maid

07:51.070 --> 07:52.330
enter that room today?

07:52.600 --> 07:53.159
Yes.

07:53.360 --> 07:54.560
I was actually

07:54.560 --> 07:56.580
standing guard outside the whole time.

07:56.580 --> 07:58.110
When I went in with the wine,

07:58.180 --> 08:00.660
I saw that the doors and windows
of Wei Zhou's house were tightly shut,

08:00.660 --> 08:02.740
with only Miss Rong present.

08:03.420 --> 08:04.820
You took one hasty glance

08:05.390 --> 08:06.790
and noticed the windows?

08:07.700 --> 08:08.900
How observant of you.

08:09.370 --> 08:10.410
What's wrong with that?

08:10.410 --> 08:12.180
We've been neighbors for many years,

08:12.180 --> 08:13.330
so I know

08:13.570 --> 08:15.640
there's only one window in his house,

08:15.950 --> 08:18.080
and I naturally noticed it right away.

08:18.510 --> 08:19.160
Miss Rong.

08:19.750 --> 08:20.600
I understand that you

08:20.600 --> 08:23.060
went to great lengths
for the birthday gift,

08:23.290 --> 08:24.690
but that doesn't justify

08:24.840 --> 08:26.080
taking someone's life.

08:26.080 --> 08:27.480
I went to Wei Zhou's house

08:28.040 --> 08:28.720
indeed for

08:28.720 --> 08:29.980
"Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku."

08:30.390 --> 08:31.040
But he went alone

08:31.040 --> 08:32.900
to get the book when he was killed.

08:33.120 --> 08:34.200
I have no idea

08:34.470 --> 08:35.309
who killed him,

08:35.309 --> 08:36.190
or why.

08:37.110 --> 08:38.919
I went with him to make a deal.

08:39.789 --> 08:41.330
On what grounds am I
accused of murder for money?

08:41.330 --> 08:42.150
That makes sense.

08:42.150 --> 08:43.270
But she was the only one there.

08:43.270 --> 08:44.530
She must be the killer.

08:46.440 --> 08:47.440
My Lord.

08:47.970 --> 08:48.600
Actually,

08:49.140 --> 08:50.080
my neighbor

08:50.080 --> 08:51.720
mentioned to me before

08:51.910 --> 08:54.150
that he wanted to use his book collection

08:54.150 --> 08:55.080
in exchange for

08:55.600 --> 08:57.180
half of the Rong family's fortune.

08:57.180 --> 08:57.660
Indeed,

08:58.120 --> 08:59.000
what he did

08:59.040 --> 09:00.250
was somewhat greedy.

09:00.600 --> 09:01.670
But Miss Rong,

09:02.230 --> 09:04.160
if you didn't want to give it to him,

09:04.460 --> 09:05.550
you didn't have to

09:05.550 --> 09:07.960
take his life.

09:08.470 --> 09:09.350
The man is dead,

09:10.080 --> 09:10.940
and these words

09:11.390 --> 09:13.090
are clearly your fabrication.

09:13.090 --> 09:13.890
Rong Shanbao!

09:14.850 --> 09:17.250
Wei Zhou was murdered
while alone with you.

09:17.830 --> 09:19.150
What else can you say?

09:19.510 --> 09:21.110
He claims I killed for money,

09:22.100 --> 09:22.790
so where is

09:22.790 --> 09:23.990
"Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku"

09:24.150 --> 09:25.550
that I supposedly stole?

09:25.970 --> 09:26.970
Isn't it obvious?

09:27.200 --> 09:28.200
Her personal maid

09:28.440 --> 09:29.790
must have taken

09:29.870 --> 09:30.630
the stolen goods

09:30.630 --> 09:31.870
when she fled

09:31.870 --> 09:33.150
in panic.

09:33.380 --> 09:33.840
My Lord,

09:34.070 --> 09:36.390
I urge you to interrogate her thoroughly.

09:36.390 --> 09:38.000
Under torture,

09:38.220 --> 09:39.770
she will surely confess.

09:41.770 --> 09:42.320
Guards!

09:42.830 --> 09:43.830
Your Excellency.

09:49.260 --> 09:49.750
Lord Lu.

09:49.750 --> 09:50.880
Why has Lord Lu come?

09:50.980 --> 09:52.360
Lord Lu is here.

10:13.790 --> 10:14.600
Investigating cases and passing judgment

10:14.600 --> 10:16.000
is my duty.

10:16.560 --> 10:18.150
Lord Jiang, why have you condescended

10:18.150 --> 10:19.610
to investigate this case personally?

10:19.610 --> 10:21.900
You and Rong Shanbao are close friends.

10:22.360 --> 10:24.760
You should recuse yourself from this case.

10:25.270 --> 10:26.130
Then, Lord Jiang,

10:26.130 --> 10:27.120
you've confronted

10:27.120 --> 10:28.150
Miss Rong at the tea plantation.

10:28.150 --> 10:29.290
Should you not recuse yourself as well

10:29.290 --> 10:30.080
to avoid others

10:30.080 --> 10:31.830
thinking you're seeking personal revenge?

10:31.830 --> 10:33.040
I've invited Lord Luo

10:33.480 --> 10:34.680
to observe this case.

10:35.240 --> 10:36.040
What's wrong?

10:36.110 --> 10:37.440
Are you suggesting

10:37.930 --> 10:39.460
Lord Luo is not fair either?

10:40.510 --> 10:41.150
Lord Luo

10:41.510 --> 10:43.040
is certainly just and fair.

10:43.170 --> 10:44.200
It's just that this case

10:44.200 --> 10:46.200
still has many suspicious aspects.

10:47.150 --> 10:49.380
Lord Jiang, you intend to proceed
with the punishment.

10:49.380 --> 10:51.600
Do you intend to extract
a false confession?

10:51.600 --> 10:52.330
Lu Jianglai.

10:53.210 --> 10:53.970
You're letting personal feelings

10:53.970 --> 10:55.190
interfere with court proceedings.

10:55.190 --> 10:57.270
Lord Jiang, don't change the subject.

10:57.270 --> 10:59.270
I'm saying this case is suspicious.

11:00.390 --> 11:01.550
Being in the same room with the deceased

11:01.550 --> 11:03.150
doesn't automatically
make one the murderer.

11:03.150 --> 11:04.610
That's far too arbitrary.

11:05.080 --> 11:07.360
Everyone knows that Rong Shanbao

11:07.360 --> 11:08.390
spared no effort

11:08.480 --> 11:09.940
for "Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku".

11:10.390 --> 11:12.550
She was the only one at the murder scene.

11:12.550 --> 11:14.720
The motive for murder
has been established.

11:14.720 --> 11:15.720
Is that being arbitrary?

11:15.720 --> 11:17.120
Currently, "Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku"

11:17.120 --> 11:18.720
is still nowhere to be found.

11:18.720 --> 11:19.510
The most urgent matter

11:19.510 --> 11:20.960
is to locate the book

11:21.600 --> 11:23.800
rather than punishing an innocent person.

11:23.800 --> 11:24.210
You...

11:31.870 --> 11:34.040
Since you two cannot come to an agreement,

11:34.040 --> 11:34.910
then this case

11:35.500 --> 11:37.670
will be personally examined by me.

11:44.390 --> 11:45.150
This matter

11:45.600 --> 11:47.130
began with a birthday gift.

11:47.440 --> 11:49.240
The Empress Dowager's birthday

11:49.360 --> 11:51.360
should be celebrated throughout the land

11:51.360 --> 11:53.560
and must not be tainted with bloodshed.

11:53.660 --> 11:54.350
Miss Rong.

11:54.950 --> 11:57.680
I have witnessed the influence
of the Rong family

11:57.790 --> 11:59.840
in Linji over the past few days.

12:00.320 --> 12:01.920
First the birthday gift was ruined,

12:01.920 --> 12:03.720
and then it became
entangled in a murder case.

12:03.720 --> 12:05.150
If this case is proven,

12:05.840 --> 12:07.960
no one can save the Rong family.

12:09.150 --> 12:09.670
Guards!

12:10.150 --> 12:11.150
Take Rong Shanbao

12:11.390 --> 12:12.440
into custody.

12:13.000 --> 12:13.730
Yes, My Lord.

12:32.170 --> 12:33.700
My Lord, you need not worry.

12:34.360 --> 12:35.680
Wei Zhou and his neighbor

12:35.680 --> 12:36.940
are people I arranged.

12:37.080 --> 12:38.120
They never actually had

12:38.120 --> 12:39.380
"Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku".

12:39.400 --> 12:41.390
As long as she has the murder motive,

12:41.390 --> 12:42.650
no matter how eloquent

12:42.870 --> 12:43.910
Rong Shanbao is,

12:44.510 --> 12:46.240
she cannot escape punishment.

12:46.910 --> 12:48.240
How did Wei Zhou die?

12:49.960 --> 12:50.630
Suicide.

12:51.870 --> 12:53.740
Wei Zhou had been ill for a long time

12:53.740 --> 12:55.470
and didn't have much time left.

12:55.510 --> 12:57.110
He wanted to leave a dowry for

12:57.320 --> 12:58.480
his daughter who left

12:58.480 --> 12:59.750
with her remarried mother.

12:59.750 --> 13:01.080
So I paid him handsomely

13:01.150 --> 13:02.280
and bought his life.

13:03.030 --> 13:04.770
No matter how this case is investigated,

13:04.770 --> 13:06.030
there will only be Rong Shanbao

13:06.030 --> 13:07.000
as the murderer.

13:09.030 --> 13:09.740
Brilliant!

13:13.300 --> 13:14.360
However, Mr. Bai,

13:14.790 --> 13:16.390
there's blood on your hands.

13:16.720 --> 13:17.720
Aren't you afraid

13:17.750 --> 13:19.880
it might affect your official career?

13:20.120 --> 13:21.270
Consider this as my

13:21.380 --> 13:22.890
pledge of loyalty to you, My Lord.

13:22.890 --> 13:23.840
My future path

13:24.150 --> 13:26.210
will greatly depend on your support.

13:30.080 --> 13:30.880
Rest assured.

13:31.440 --> 13:32.240
In the future,

13:32.410 --> 13:35.070
I will certainly help you
rise to great heights.

14:15.100 --> 14:15.700
Mr. An,

14:16.630 --> 14:17.910
where are you heading?

14:18.720 --> 14:19.360
I...

14:20.400 --> 14:20.920
Mr. An,

14:21.840 --> 14:23.550
I'm returning to Rong Mansion now.

14:23.550 --> 14:25.870
Before I leave,
I want to remind you of something.

14:25.870 --> 14:27.470
A person can't be too greedy.

14:28.030 --> 14:29.560
If you want a peaceful life,

14:30.130 --> 14:31.660
you must give up something.

14:42.230 --> 14:43.630
Can I have a word with you?

14:52.550 --> 14:53.880
From the very beginning

14:54.120 --> 14:55.650
you've all been lying to me.

14:55.840 --> 14:56.910
You don't really think

14:56.910 --> 14:59.370
that good fortune
falls from the sky, do you?

14:59.400 --> 15:00.270
You should be grateful

15:00.270 --> 15:01.870
that you still have some use.

15:02.400 --> 15:04.530
Otherwise, who would even notice you?

15:05.270 --> 15:06.120
You're doing quite well

15:06.120 --> 15:07.630
at the Provincial Governor's Office.

15:07.630 --> 15:08.510
It's better than having

15:08.510 --> 15:10.240
that heartless Lady Yunxi

15:10.840 --> 15:13.150
who refuses to acknowledge your existence.

15:13.150 --> 15:14.630
She is not heartless.

15:15.510 --> 15:17.170
I made this choice willingly.

15:21.320 --> 15:22.750
Lord Jiang is not

15:22.750 --> 15:23.880
a man of good temper.

15:24.220 --> 15:26.220
I advise you not to be foolish again.

15:26.830 --> 15:28.160
If you serve Lord Jiang,

15:28.510 --> 15:30.370
he will certainly treat you well.

15:30.790 --> 15:32.320
When the Rong family falls,

15:32.500 --> 15:33.700
you and your daughter

15:37.980 --> 15:39.620
will rise to great heights.

15:49.770 --> 15:51.430
Hurry up. Don't take too long.

16:10.750 --> 16:11.510
Mr. Yan.

16:15.390 --> 16:16.320
Why are you here?

16:16.840 --> 16:17.910
They're wrongfully accusing you,

16:17.910 --> 16:18.640
aren't they?

16:19.320 --> 16:19.870
Yes.

16:20.550 --> 16:22.080
Is there any way out of this?

16:23.360 --> 16:24.440
They've set a trap

16:24.870 --> 16:26.270
waiting for me to fall in.

16:26.440 --> 16:28.570
They'll certainly make me pay dearly.

16:28.850 --> 16:30.650
I have an answer to that question

16:31.930 --> 16:33.190
you asked me last time.

16:34.000 --> 16:34.600
What is it?

16:38.390 --> 16:39.120
I'm willing.

16:40.200 --> 16:41.000
Lady Shanbao.

16:41.600 --> 16:42.730
I'm willing to stay,

16:43.400 --> 16:45.060
even without the Rong family.

16:46.360 --> 16:47.150
All my life,

16:47.960 --> 16:48.870
every decision I've made

16:48.870 --> 16:51.000
has required careful consideration.

16:51.130 --> 16:51.860
But that day,

16:52.160 --> 16:52.840
I didn't promptly

16:52.840 --> 16:54.100
answer your question.

16:54.250 --> 16:55.780
I've regretted it for days.

16:56.130 --> 16:56.660
I believe

16:57.870 --> 16:58.920
this is my answer.

17:00.590 --> 17:01.520
Even if this time

17:01.870 --> 17:03.320
you have no way to clear your name,

17:03.320 --> 17:04.270
I'll do everything possible

17:04.270 --> 17:04.930
to save you.

17:05.589 --> 17:06.400
Even if it means

17:06.400 --> 17:08.200
we become fugitives afterward.

17:08.720 --> 17:09.980
As long as you trust me.

17:14.920 --> 17:17.050
-You...
-Shut up if you can’t save her.

17:18.550 --> 17:21.680
Why talk about becoming fugitives
when there's no need?

17:37.750 --> 17:38.310
Mr. Yan,

17:39.150 --> 17:41.060
I need to discuss the case
with Lady Shanbao.

17:41.060 --> 17:42.200
Please excuse us.

17:44.960 --> 17:46.620
Mr. Yan, please go back first.

17:47.070 --> 17:47.800
I understand

17:48.590 --> 17:49.450
your feelings.

18:04.030 --> 18:04.590
Look,

18:04.920 --> 18:06.920
a pure, flawless disciple of Buddha

18:07.270 --> 18:09.920
is willing to flee
with you to the ends of the earth.

18:09.920 --> 18:11.350
How touching.

18:11.790 --> 18:12.720
Speak properly.

18:14.010 --> 18:15.740
What exactly are you planning?

18:15.900 --> 18:16.900
Looking for a book

18:17.010 --> 18:19.240
and somehow
getting yourself thrown in jail.

18:19.240 --> 18:19.830
There are too many people

18:19.830 --> 18:21.200
watching me like hawks.

18:22.810 --> 18:24.540
I can't guard against them all.

18:44.400 --> 18:45.110
What are you

18:45.610 --> 18:46.740
planning to do next?

18:47.530 --> 18:49.860
I don't believe you'll just admit defeat.

18:51.340 --> 18:52.270
I have a plan.

18:55.110 --> 18:56.110
I need your help.

18:56.900 --> 18:58.230
What do you want me to do?

18:58.400 --> 19:00.060
I should warn you beforehand.

19:00.440 --> 19:02.270
This matter carries enormous risk.

19:02.270 --> 19:03.110
One misstep,

19:03.950 --> 19:05.610
and you could be dragged down as well.

19:05.610 --> 19:06.280
So what?

19:07.270 --> 19:08.440
Someone already has the role

19:08.440 --> 19:09.570
of fleeing with you.

19:09.750 --> 19:10.940
I should at least have

19:10.940 --> 19:12.670
the title of sharing your fate.

19:18.300 --> 19:19.030
Lady Yunshu,

19:20.410 --> 19:23.140
you're still in the mood
to tend to these flowers?

19:25.960 --> 19:27.400
Tomorrow will be the fifth day.

19:27.400 --> 19:28.070
Your freedom

19:28.070 --> 19:29.530
to come and go at Rong Mansion

19:29.530 --> 19:30.390
is about to end.

19:33.590 --> 19:35.120
It seems you haven't heard.

19:35.400 --> 19:37.550
Rong Shanbao,
in her search for a birthday tribute,

19:37.550 --> 19:38.680
committed a murder.

19:39.200 --> 19:40.200
Your Rong Mansion

19:41.170 --> 19:42.500
is headed for disaster.

19:45.990 --> 19:46.720
Impossible.

19:47.270 --> 19:48.600
She's not that foolish.

19:48.960 --> 19:50.300
It's often the clever ones

19:50.300 --> 19:51.360
who make mistakes.

19:57.080 --> 19:58.230
You framed her.

20:01.250 --> 20:03.250
I wasn't ruthless enough back then.

20:03.440 --> 20:05.500
I should have let you die in the river.

20:12.800 --> 20:14.200
Sorry to disappoint you.

20:18.110 --> 20:19.880
Heaven wasn't ready for me.

20:22.630 --> 20:23.440
Rong Yunshu.

20:26.880 --> 20:28.740
I'll give you a way out, all right?

20:31.070 --> 20:32.130
You are to identify

20:32.880 --> 20:34.720
Rong Shanbao as the one who,
out of resentment,

20:34.720 --> 20:36.380
burned down the Tea King Tree.

20:36.880 --> 20:39.010
I'll plead with Lord Jiang to spare you

20:39.330 --> 20:41.000
and even grant you

20:41.380 --> 20:43.580
one of the Rong family's tea mountains.

20:45.370 --> 20:47.100
We daughters of the Rong family

20:47.270 --> 20:48.830
may fight for power,

20:50.340 --> 20:51.510
but would never betray each other

20:51.510 --> 20:52.970
just to save our own skins.

21:08.270 --> 21:10.050
[Linji Prefectural Office]

21:14.470 --> 21:15.130
We're here.

21:17.000 --> 21:18.550
Miao'er, strike the drum.

21:23.410 --> 21:24.400
What's happening?

21:24.400 --> 21:25.330
What's going on?

21:25.720 --> 21:27.030
Someone is striking the drum.

21:27.030 --> 21:28.310
Why is it a little girl?

21:35.490 --> 21:37.290
This set of "Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku"

21:37.790 --> 21:39.850
belongs to my Wei family collection.

21:40.310 --> 21:42.100
During the confiscation years ago,

21:42.100 --> 21:44.100
it was hidden in a screen by my family

21:44.470 --> 21:45.930
and escaped being seized.

21:46.270 --> 21:48.270
I've been hiding it all these years.

21:48.690 --> 21:50.750
No matter how difficult life became,

21:50.980 --> 21:52.910
I endured and persevered.

21:53.440 --> 21:55.030
I chose to hang on a bit longer.

21:55.030 --> 21:56.550
I thought when the day came

21:56.550 --> 21:58.550
when we couldn't make ends meet anymore,

21:58.550 --> 22:00.210
I would take it out and sell it.

22:01.110 --> 22:02.110
Fortunately,

22:02.960 --> 22:04.030
our Wei family

22:04.480 --> 22:05.680
has been exonerated.

22:06.350 --> 22:08.410
Yesterday, my granddaughter told me

22:08.500 --> 22:11.220
there was a murder in town
because of this book.

22:12.010 --> 22:13.160
My heart

22:13.630 --> 22:15.720
was truly filled with anxiety.

22:16.550 --> 22:19.120
So I brought this book

22:19.720 --> 22:21.200
and hurried over here.

22:30.540 --> 22:32.760
[Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku]

22:42.270 --> 22:43.160
You mean

22:43.600 --> 22:45.360
this is "Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku"?

22:45.970 --> 22:46.770
That's right.

22:47.360 --> 22:48.560
Back then, Wei Kejian

22:48.830 --> 22:49.830
built a library

22:50.200 --> 22:51.790
and kept this Song Dynasty edition

22:51.790 --> 22:53.830
as his family's most treasured possession.

22:53.830 --> 22:55.630
Before the library caught fire,

22:56.020 --> 22:56.830
Wei Kejian

22:57.300 --> 22:58.360
had already hidden

22:58.720 --> 22:59.980
this set of books away.

23:00.030 --> 23:01.030
By chance,

23:01.400 --> 23:03.000
it ended up in my possession.

23:03.200 --> 23:05.200
If this collection is in your hands,

23:05.620 --> 23:07.160
then Wei Zhou, who answered
the reward notice yesterday

23:07.160 --> 23:08.680
and died unnaturally,

23:08.880 --> 23:09.640
was lying.

23:10.330 --> 23:11.030
In that case,

23:11.030 --> 23:12.620
Lady Rong Shanbao's motive for murder

23:12.620 --> 23:14.420
becomes even more nonexistent.

23:14.480 --> 23:15.880
Whether it's true or not,

23:15.880 --> 23:17.480
how can we rely on one person's word?

23:17.480 --> 23:18.480
Lord Jiang, previously

23:18.480 --> 23:19.510
you also just believed

23:19.510 --> 23:21.960
the testimony
of Wei Zhou's neighbor, didn't you?

23:21.960 --> 23:23.400
Now that the real "Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku"

23:23.400 --> 23:24.200
has appeared,

23:24.580 --> 23:26.070
it proves that Wei Zhou and his neighbor

23:26.070 --> 23:27.200
had ill intentions.

23:27.510 --> 23:28.640
Perhaps they conspired together

23:28.640 --> 23:30.270
to deceive Lady Rong Shanbao,

23:30.270 --> 23:32.160
but quarreled over dividing the spoils.

23:32.160 --> 23:33.440
After accidentally killing Wei Zhou,

23:33.440 --> 23:35.030
the neighbor framed Lady Rong Shanbao.

23:35.030 --> 23:35.760
Lu Jianglai,

23:36.410 --> 23:37.000
your reasoning

23:37.000 --> 23:38.480
is far too arbitrary.

23:38.960 --> 23:41.000
Lord Jiang, you only relied on hearsay

23:41.000 --> 23:42.230
to conclude that Lady Rong Shanbao

23:42.230 --> 23:44.020
killed someone for a set of books.

23:44.020 --> 23:45.080
Isn't that equally arbitrary?

23:45.080 --> 23:45.930
Nonsense!

23:46.270 --> 23:46.880
Enough!

23:48.480 --> 23:50.240
This case has too many suspicious points.

23:50.240 --> 23:52.170
How can we make wild speculations?

23:53.270 --> 23:55.900
First, we need someone
to verify
if this set of books is authentic.

23:55.900 --> 23:56.750
Tomorrow,

23:57.460 --> 24:00.260
I will investigate
until the truth comes to light.

24:02.480 --> 24:03.740
Lord Luo, you're wise.

24:10.200 --> 24:10.960
Although I spoke

24:10.960 --> 24:12.690
in righteous terms at the time,

24:13.360 --> 24:14.230
on reflection

24:14.790 --> 24:16.530
I still felt a measure of unease.

24:16.530 --> 24:17.790
That woman, Ms. Chang,

24:18.070 --> 24:18.830
out of gratitude

24:18.830 --> 24:20.240
for my help with her case,

24:20.870 --> 24:21.720
was willing to bring a fake copy

24:21.720 --> 24:23.780
of "Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku" as evidence,

24:23.980 --> 24:25.380
but a fake is still a fake.

24:25.890 --> 24:27.020
If it's discovered,

24:27.070 --> 24:28.880
the punishment will be even more severe,

24:28.880 --> 24:30.210
and we'll never
be able to clear our names.

24:30.210 --> 24:31.810
I've already told you before

24:32.140 --> 24:33.640
this matter carries enormous risk.

24:33.640 --> 24:35.300
I'm not worried about myself.

24:35.590 --> 24:37.120
I only worry whether you can

24:37.160 --> 24:38.550
see this through safely.

24:38.550 --> 24:41.070
I've been offering a generous reward
for so many days

24:41.070 --> 24:43.670
but still haven't found
any trace of this book.

24:43.680 --> 24:44.750
I suspect the book

24:45.590 --> 24:46.960
was probably destroyed

24:46.960 --> 24:48.490
in that fire at the library.

24:49.270 --> 24:49.920
Probably?

24:51.620 --> 24:52.680
Lady Rong Shanbao,

24:53.330 --> 24:54.480
when did your actions

24:54.480 --> 24:55.880
become so questionable?

24:56.310 --> 24:57.830
You're overlooking something.

24:57.830 --> 24:58.310
What?

24:59.320 --> 25:00.310
Few people

25:00.720 --> 25:01.400
have ever seen the real

25:01.400 --> 25:02.660
"Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku."

25:06.720 --> 25:07.770
Have you thought about

25:07.770 --> 25:08.970
how to conclude this?

25:10.200 --> 25:10.840
Surely

25:11.100 --> 25:13.030
you don't really intend to present
a fake Song Dynasty edition

25:13.030 --> 25:14.360
to the Empress Dowager?

25:14.990 --> 25:16.650
That would be a serious crime.

25:16.680 --> 25:19.340
The real Song Dynasty edition
no longer exists.

25:19.640 --> 25:20.400
Now if we say

25:20.400 --> 25:22.200
what Ms. Chang has is authentic,

25:22.590 --> 25:23.790
then it is authentic.

25:27.700 --> 25:29.560
Are you hiding something from me?

25:29.590 --> 25:30.990
You've helped me so much.

25:31.830 --> 25:33.960
I've been completely honest with you.

25:42.370 --> 25:43.270
That Rong Shanbao

25:43.270 --> 25:45.130
is truly reckless beyond belief.

25:45.750 --> 25:46.480
She actually thought of

25:46.480 --> 25:48.740
using this method to break the deadlock.

25:48.830 --> 25:49.630
That old woman

25:49.830 --> 25:51.430
who owes Lu Jianglai a debt of gratitude

25:51.430 --> 25:53.400
must have been used
by them to create this deception.

25:53.400 --> 25:54.400
This is good news.

25:54.680 --> 25:56.510
Lu Jianglai is rushing here
to his own death.

25:56.510 --> 25:58.110
We can catch them all at once.

25:58.440 --> 25:58.920
Okay.

25:59.890 --> 26:01.830
I'll go right now
to instruct that neighbor

26:01.830 --> 26:04.050
to stick firmly to the story
that Rong Shanbao committed murder.

26:04.050 --> 26:05.120
If he dares to waver...

26:05.120 --> 26:06.520
No need for that trouble.

26:06.960 --> 26:08.290
Come over here and look.

26:20.350 --> 26:21.830
The authentic "Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku"

26:21.830 --> 26:22.640
is in my hands.

26:24.430 --> 26:25.350
Rong Shanbao

26:25.810 --> 26:27.810
walked right into the trap herself.

26:31.630 --> 26:32.960
Is this book authentic?

26:33.880 --> 26:35.000
I got this

26:35.200 --> 26:36.640
from Wei Kejian before.

26:37.160 --> 26:38.760
It's absolutely authentic.

26:39.320 --> 26:40.120
Just tell them

26:40.280 --> 26:42.480
you found this book during the search.

26:42.860 --> 26:45.200
An Cha and his daughter
are at the County Office now.

26:45.200 --> 26:46.400
Send a letter

26:46.400 --> 26:47.460
to Lady Rong Yunxi.

26:47.830 --> 26:48.830
Ask her to testify

26:49.250 --> 26:51.570
that she saw this book at your place.

26:51.830 --> 26:53.080
This will ensure Rong Shanbao

26:53.080 --> 26:54.480
can never clear her name.

26:58.500 --> 26:59.570
Rest assured, My Lord.

26:59.570 --> 27:01.830
I will certainly complete this mission.

27:16.620 --> 27:17.620
Li, be a good girl.

27:17.680 --> 27:18.310
In a moment,

27:18.310 --> 27:19.880
I want to play a little game with you.

27:19.880 --> 27:21.160
No matter what happens,

27:21.160 --> 27:22.160
you must not make any noise.

27:22.160 --> 27:22.750
Alright?

27:23.400 --> 27:24.030
Good girl.

27:24.400 --> 27:24.840
Come.

27:25.490 --> 27:25.970
Now,

27:26.200 --> 27:27.260
I'll cover you with this.

27:27.260 --> 27:27.740
Okay?

28:17.600 --> 28:18.130
This way!

28:21.500 --> 28:22.550
They ran this way!

28:22.750 --> 28:23.150
Hurry!

28:23.240 --> 28:23.990
Split up and chase them!

28:23.990 --> 28:24.520
Yes, sir.

28:34.350 --> 28:35.340
Li, listen carefully.

28:35.340 --> 28:36.440
That tea plantation ahead

28:36.440 --> 28:37.590
is where you used to live.

28:37.590 --> 28:38.520
Do you remember?

28:39.240 --> 28:40.550
I want to play a game with you.

28:40.550 --> 28:41.440
Let's have a race.

28:41.440 --> 28:42.750
Whoever gets there first wins.

28:42.750 --> 28:43.240
Okay?

28:43.630 --> 28:44.020
Go.

28:44.440 --> 28:45.370
That direction.

28:45.570 --> 28:46.000
Hurry.

28:47.590 --> 28:48.990
I'll be right behind you.

28:49.210 --> 28:49.870
Li, be good.

28:50.680 --> 28:52.350
Remember to go to the plantation

28:52.350 --> 28:52.830
and find

28:52.830 --> 28:55.160
the big sister
who took care of you before.

28:57.160 --> 28:58.030
Run quickly.

28:59.840 --> 29:00.750
Don't fall.

29:03.090 --> 29:04.070
Don't look back.

29:29.400 --> 29:29.920
Tell me

29:30.880 --> 29:32.210
where your daughter is.

29:34.400 --> 29:36.280
You won't talk? Beat him!

29:40.560 --> 29:41.080
Stop!

30:12.590 --> 30:13.310
I'm sorry.

30:15.160 --> 30:16.360
You fool.

30:22.610 --> 30:25.220
[Linji Prefectural Office]

30:25.480 --> 30:26.440
Our Wei family

30:26.880 --> 30:28.810
have also been wrongfully accused

30:29.000 --> 30:30.530
and suffered humiliation.

30:31.310 --> 30:32.790
Today I step forward

30:33.510 --> 30:34.640
because I don't want

30:34.790 --> 30:37.390
to see another Wei family
suffer the same fate.

30:37.560 --> 30:39.160
I don't want innocent people

30:40.390 --> 30:42.190
to be wrongfully accused again.

30:42.720 --> 30:44.110
"Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku"

30:44.510 --> 30:46.310
has always been hidden by me

30:47.500 --> 30:50.590
and never fell into others' hands.

30:51.000 --> 30:52.350
This precious book

30:52.990 --> 30:53.880
carries

30:54.140 --> 30:55.250
all the wisdom

30:55.830 --> 30:57.960
of our ancestors throughout history.

30:58.030 --> 30:59.160
It should not become

30:59.610 --> 31:01.850
evidence for false accusations.

31:02.160 --> 31:04.360
A housewife with such noble character.

31:04.710 --> 31:05.840
We who serve in court

31:06.350 --> 31:07.590
should be even more discerning

31:07.590 --> 31:08.720
and uphold justice.

31:09.720 --> 31:10.310
Lord Luo,

31:11.100 --> 31:14.360
how is the verification of
the Song Dynasty edition going?

31:15.750 --> 31:16.550
Rong Shanbao,

31:17.540 --> 31:18.430
I ask you:

31:19.330 --> 31:20.510
do you truly not know why Wei Zhou

31:20.510 --> 31:21.510
died?

31:22.750 --> 31:23.310
Lord Luo,

31:24.160 --> 31:26.110
I've already stated clearly before.

31:26.110 --> 31:27.400
I went to Wei Zhou's house

31:27.400 --> 31:28.510
to make a deal.

31:29.480 --> 31:31.440
Even if the deal falls through,
we can still part as friends.

31:31.440 --> 31:32.480
The Rong family has never

31:32.480 --> 31:34.210
bullied others with our power.

31:34.310 --> 31:36.240
Not to mention murder and robbery.

31:36.590 --> 31:37.590
As for why Wei Zhou

31:38.030 --> 31:38.880
died in a room

31:38.880 --> 31:40.810
with all doors and windows locked,

31:41.200 --> 31:42.660
I'm afraid only he himself

31:42.930 --> 31:44.810
and this good neighbor would know.

31:44.810 --> 31:45.960
When Wei Zhou died,

31:45.960 --> 31:47.360
I wasn't even in the room.

31:47.550 --> 31:48.880
How dare you slander me?

31:49.440 --> 31:51.640
You didn't actually see me kill anyone.

31:51.750 --> 31:53.400
You only saw Wei Zhou after he was dead,

31:53.400 --> 31:54.860
when I was in the same room.

31:55.310 --> 31:57.640
What grounds do you have
to falsely accuse me of murder?

31:57.640 --> 31:58.710
You... I...

31:59.510 --> 32:00.160
Lord Luo.

32:01.160 --> 32:02.550
This case is very clear.

32:03.590 --> 32:04.590
Someone powerful

32:04.980 --> 32:06.160
holds a grudge against me

32:06.160 --> 32:07.760
because of past grievances.

32:08.360 --> 32:09.200
Knowing I was looking for

32:09.200 --> 32:10.460
"Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku",

32:10.810 --> 32:11.980
he set a trap

32:12.160 --> 32:13.850
to lure me into Wei Zhou's house,

32:13.850 --> 32:15.110
then committed murder

32:15.280 --> 32:16.410
and framed me for it.

32:16.860 --> 32:19.590
I will investigate
Wei Zhou's death thoroughly.

32:20.650 --> 32:22.550
Since there's insufficient evidence,

32:22.550 --> 32:23.350
Rong Shanbao,

32:23.880 --> 32:25.740
you may return to the Rong family.

32:25.830 --> 32:27.690
But before this case is resolved,

32:28.110 --> 32:29.510
you must not leave Linji.

32:30.240 --> 32:31.370
Thank you, Lord Luo.

32:32.920 --> 32:33.480
Ma'am.

32:34.150 --> 32:35.720
I wish to buy your copy
of "Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku"

32:35.720 --> 32:36.750
at a high price.

32:37.520 --> 32:38.110
Would you

32:38.630 --> 32:40.090
be willing to part with it?

32:40.270 --> 32:41.870
Lady Shanbao, if you like it,

32:42.000 --> 32:43.480
I'll simply give it to you.

32:43.880 --> 32:44.720
I only ask that

32:45.160 --> 32:47.340
if Wei's descendants ever face hardship,

32:47.340 --> 32:48.140
Lady Shanbao,

32:48.460 --> 32:50.390
you would lend them a helping hand.

32:50.440 --> 32:51.050
Okay.

32:51.710 --> 32:52.440
I promise.

32:53.030 --> 32:53.710
Thank you.

33:01.680 --> 33:02.310
Lord Luo,

33:03.000 --> 33:04.200
"Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku"

33:04.440 --> 33:07.110
is the crystallization
of countless people's devotion and labor.

33:07.110 --> 33:08.170
Books are innocent

33:08.460 --> 33:10.990
and shouldn't be tainted
by worldly desires.

33:14.550 --> 33:17.310
I humbly dare to present
this work as a birthday tribute,

33:17.310 --> 33:19.370
and ask that Your Lordship accept it.

33:19.950 --> 33:20.500
Wait.

33:36.290 --> 33:36.920
Lord Luo,

33:38.140 --> 33:39.610
This copy of "Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku"

33:39.610 --> 33:40.360
is fake.

33:41.060 --> 33:43.020
The authentic one is in my hands.

33:58.920 --> 34:01.380
My surname is Bai,
courtesy name Yingsheng,

34:01.480 --> 34:03.280
a student from Wanfeng Academy.

34:03.880 --> 34:04.830
Since childhood,

34:04.830 --> 34:06.480
I've loved collecting old books.

34:06.480 --> 34:07.350
This Song Dynasty edition

34:07.350 --> 34:09.150
has been in my collection for 2 years.

34:09.150 --> 34:10.350
A few days ago, I heard

34:10.540 --> 34:12.800
someone was passing off
a fake as authentic,

34:12.800 --> 34:13.800
so I hurried here.

34:14.670 --> 34:16.480
The matter of authenticity
shouldn't concern me.

34:16.480 --> 34:17.000
But

34:17.570 --> 34:19.070
I study the classics,

34:20.030 --> 34:21.830
and cannot stand to see this used

34:22.440 --> 34:23.900
to deceive the sovereign.

34:35.880 --> 34:36.590
Madam Wei,

34:37.360 --> 34:38.690
how do you explain this?

34:38.800 --> 34:40.000
I... I...

34:40.630 --> 34:42.290
You claim yours is authentic.

34:42.800 --> 34:43.929
How can you prove it?

34:45.630 --> 34:46.489
A reproduction

34:46.960 --> 34:49.159
is naturally inferior to the original.

34:49.760 --> 34:51.550
The difference between these two

34:51.550 --> 34:53.030
is obvious to anyone.

34:55.960 --> 34:56.620
Lord Jiang,

34:57.840 --> 34:58.470
I've heard

34:59.440 --> 35:01.100
you're also a book collector.

35:01.710 --> 35:02.320
Perhaps

35:03.340 --> 35:05.870
you could help determine
which is authentic.

35:07.610 --> 35:08.170
Okay.

35:38.320 --> 35:38.760
Li.

35:39.840 --> 35:40.360
Li.

35:41.060 --> 35:41.660
Li.

35:44.440 --> 35:45.240
You're awake.

35:45.480 --> 35:46.140
Lady Yunxi.

35:46.710 --> 35:47.440
Jiang Yiqian

35:47.800 --> 35:48.320
and Bai Yingsheng

35:48.320 --> 35:50.030
are plotting against Lady Shanbao.

35:50.030 --> 35:51.230
And that Wei Zhou too.

35:51.250 --> 35:52.300
He and his neighbors

35:52.300 --> 35:53.500
are working for them.

35:53.770 --> 35:55.030
They also want to use Li

35:55.550 --> 35:58.920
to blackmail you into helping them
coordinate their testimonies.

35:58.920 --> 35:59.580
Where is Li?

35:59.960 --> 36:02.420
Did she make it safely
to the tea plantation?

36:09.240 --> 36:09.840
I'm sorry.

36:11.280 --> 36:13.010
Xiangling is taking care of Li.

36:18.210 --> 36:18.940
That's good.

36:20.820 --> 36:21.420
By the way,

36:22.110 --> 36:23.400
is the trial today?

36:23.960 --> 36:24.840
I can testify.

36:24.980 --> 36:26.190
I heard with my own ears

36:26.190 --> 36:27.030
Bai Yingsheng and Jiang Yiqian's

36:27.030 --> 36:27.760
conspiracy.

36:28.620 --> 36:29.230
You risked your life

36:29.230 --> 36:31.880
escaping from
the Provincial Governor's Office

36:31.880 --> 36:33.280
just to tell me this?

36:35.110 --> 36:35.840
I'm so sorry.

36:36.760 --> 36:37.320
Before,

36:38.070 --> 36:39.330
I believed the slander

36:40.280 --> 36:41.680
and that's why I hurt you.

36:42.420 --> 36:43.920
If there's any way to make amends,

36:43.920 --> 36:45.380
even at the cost of my life,

36:46.300 --> 36:47.110
I am willing.

36:56.080 --> 36:58.410
It seems I've underestimated you before.

36:58.760 --> 37:00.030
With a father like you,

37:01.190 --> 37:01.840
no wonder Li

37:01.840 --> 37:03.100
called me a bad person.

37:05.730 --> 37:07.060
I didn't teach her that.

37:09.110 --> 37:10.640
Now is not the time for this.

37:11.070 --> 37:13.400
I need to get to
the County Office quickly.

37:14.680 --> 37:16.730
The fact that you're in my courtyard now,

37:16.730 --> 37:17.360
don't you understand

37:17.360 --> 37:18.690
what's really going on?

37:22.630 --> 37:24.840
Based on my book collecting experience,

37:24.840 --> 37:26.320
Bai Yingsheng's Song Dynasty edition

37:26.320 --> 37:27.520
is the authentic one.

37:29.280 --> 37:30.940
Good that you've admitted it.

37:39.280 --> 37:40.480
What's going on here?

37:40.630 --> 37:41.760
What does this mean?

37:41.970 --> 37:43.150
What does she mean by that?

37:43.150 --> 37:43.680
Lord Luo,

37:44.260 --> 37:45.640
I wish to file charges against

37:45.640 --> 37:47.370
Governor Jiang Yiqian of Linji

37:47.480 --> 37:48.550
for corruption and perversion of justice,

37:48.550 --> 37:49.810
for his personal gain,

37:49.840 --> 37:51.210
persecuting the innocent,

37:51.210 --> 37:52.230
and forcing the Wei family

37:52.230 --> 37:53.280
to complete ruin.

38:00.760 --> 38:01.670
Nonsense!

38:02.130 --> 38:02.930
Rong Shanbao,

38:03.670 --> 38:05.430
even though we have had our differences,

38:05.430 --> 38:07.230
you cannot slander me like this.

38:07.280 --> 38:08.440
I have never accepted

38:08.440 --> 38:09.640
even a penny in bribes.

38:09.640 --> 38:10.920
I am completely innocent

38:10.920 --> 38:12.230
as heaven and earth can attest!

38:12.230 --> 38:14.560
Lord Jiang, you may not have taken bribes,

38:14.630 --> 38:16.290
but you're far from innocent.

38:17.010 --> 38:18.960
The Wei family not only
ran a tea plantation,

38:18.960 --> 38:20.900
but also built
a special tower to store books.

38:20.900 --> 38:21.960
Lord Jiang has repeatedly

38:21.960 --> 38:23.000
borrowed from the Wei family

38:23.000 --> 38:24.920
precious manuscripts for printing.

38:24.920 --> 38:26.280
However, "Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku"

38:26.280 --> 38:28.360
is the Wei family'
most treasured possession.

38:28.360 --> 38:30.150
Lord Jiang requested
to borrow it 3 times

38:30.150 --> 38:31.780
and was politely refused each time.

38:31.780 --> 38:33.770
You were humiliated by the Wei family

38:33.770 --> 38:35.960
and have harbored resentment toward them.

38:35.960 --> 38:37.190
That's why you arbitrarily ruled that

38:37.190 --> 38:38.650
Wei Kejian was a murderer.

38:38.800 --> 38:40.570
When the Wei family continued to appeal,

38:40.570 --> 38:42.280
you covered up your wrong judgment

38:42.280 --> 38:44.900
by pressuring officials
to sentence the Wei family to death.

38:44.900 --> 38:46.500
Any officials who disobeyed

38:46.670 --> 38:48.070
were thrown into prison.

38:48.440 --> 38:49.510
You also chose to ignore the fact

38:49.510 --> 38:50.840
that Xu Song passed
a male corpse off as female

38:50.840 --> 38:51.690
and and murdered witnesses

38:51.690 --> 38:52.670
to silence them.

38:53.230 --> 38:54.470
Even after the case was solved,

38:54.470 --> 38:56.320
you still refused to spare Madam Yang.

38:56.320 --> 38:57.580
You're slandering me!

38:57.840 --> 38:59.110
These are all baseless accusations!

38:59.110 --> 38:59.970
It's all false!

39:00.190 --> 39:01.150
Lord Jiang, just now you

39:01.150 --> 39:02.110
admitted with your own mouth

39:02.110 --> 39:04.370
that this Song Dynasty edition
is authentic.

39:04.370 --> 39:06.620
You personally gave this to Bai Yingsheng,

39:06.620 --> 39:09.280
which serves as
self-incriminating evidence.

39:20.160 --> 39:20.640
My Lord,

39:21.670 --> 39:23.710
forgive me for my deception earlier.

39:23.710 --> 39:25.570
This copy of "Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku"

39:26.610 --> 39:29.010
was indeed given
to me by Lord Jiang Yiqian,

39:29.330 --> 39:31.990
who instructed me
to implicate Lady Rong Shanbao.

39:31.990 --> 39:32.480
Before this,

39:32.480 --> 39:34.400
I had been staying
at the Provincial Governor's Office

39:34.400 --> 39:35.060
actually to

39:35.210 --> 39:37.670
collect evidence of Jiang Yiqian's crimes.

39:40.680 --> 39:42.280
You're all in this together!

39:43.030 --> 39:44.490
You're trying to frame me!

39:44.670 --> 39:45.930
You're the murderers!

39:46.070 --> 39:48.600
You are the ones
truly guilty of grave crimes!

40:20.340 --> 40:21.270
What's going on?

40:34.020 --> 40:34.950
Don't be afraid.

40:35.160 --> 40:36.770
Everyone, please don't be afraid.

40:36.770 --> 40:38.330
I am but a humble performer

40:38.840 --> 40:42.100
skilled in the art of holding my breath
and feigning death.

40:48.510 --> 40:49.310
Rong Shanbao.

40:50.360 --> 40:51.320
What's going on?

40:52.070 --> 40:52.630
My Lord,

40:53.550 --> 40:55.360
I heard from Madam Yang

40:55.360 --> 40:57.700
about the existence
of "Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku".

40:57.700 --> 40:58.480
I later learned

40:58.480 --> 41:00.670
that Lord Jiang
once requested it but was refused.

41:00.670 --> 41:02.790
So when I discovered
this book was missing,

41:02.790 --> 41:03.990
I became suspicious.

41:04.590 --> 41:05.920
That's why I sent Bai Yingsheng

41:05.920 --> 41:07.110
to Lord Jiang's side

41:07.110 --> 41:08.570
to investigate the truth.

41:08.670 --> 41:10.400
While searching for this book,

41:10.840 --> 41:11.550
I learned from

41:11.550 --> 41:13.610
an elderly clerk at the County Office

41:13.670 --> 41:16.440
about the feud
between Jiang Yiqian and Wei Kejian.

41:16.440 --> 41:18.300
I just lacked concrete evidence.

41:18.800 --> 41:20.860
I knew Jiang Yiqian is narrow-minded

41:21.320 --> 41:23.510
and has long seen me
as a thorn in his side.

41:23.510 --> 41:25.040
That's why I set up this trap

41:25.630 --> 41:28.510
to make Jiang Yiqian
produce evidence of his own crimes.

41:28.510 --> 41:29.190
Now

41:29.710 --> 41:31.590
we have both witness
and physical evidence.

41:31.590 --> 41:33.580
Lord Luo, I request Your Lordship
thoroughly investigate

41:33.580 --> 41:35.010
and arrest the true culprit

41:35.010 --> 41:36.750
to avoid wronging innocent families

41:36.750 --> 41:38.150
and perverting justice.

41:46.510 --> 41:48.960
Jiang Yiqian has been
reckless in his actions

41:48.960 --> 41:50.760
and brought harm to this region.

41:50.780 --> 41:51.260
Guards!

41:52.150 --> 41:53.070
Take him away!

41:58.630 --> 42:00.480
My Lord, this is unjust!

42:01.030 --> 42:01.630
My Lord!

42:02.630 --> 42:04.710
Lord Luo, I've been wronged!

42:05.020 --> 42:07.180
Lord Luo, this is unjust!

42:07.630 --> 42:08.550
Lord Luo!

42:09.960 --> 42:11.110
Lord Luo!

42:11.470 --> 42:12.280
Rong Shanbao.

42:13.480 --> 42:15.510
Although this case has hidden aspects,

42:15.510 --> 42:17.230
your fabrication of a murder case

42:17.230 --> 42:19.960
and mockery of this court
is also disrespectful.

42:20.110 --> 42:22.360
I beg Your Lordship
to dismiss all those not involved.

42:22.360 --> 42:23.960
I have something to tell you.

42:28.970 --> 42:30.170
Everyone, withdraw!

42:34.070 --> 42:34.920
All of you, go back.

42:34.920 --> 42:35.630
That's enough.

42:35.630 --> 42:36.360
Disperse now.

42:36.360 --> 42:37.560
Go back. Hurry along.

42:44.920 --> 42:45.760
Lord Lu.

43:10.150 --> 43:10.840
Miss Rong.

43:11.510 --> 43:12.970
What do you wish to tell me?

43:13.230 --> 43:13.710
My Lord,

43:14.960 --> 43:16.620
my gift to the Empress Dowager

43:17.000 --> 43:17.590
is not merely

43:17.590 --> 43:19.670
this precious
Song Dynasty book collection,

43:19.670 --> 43:21.470
but the case behind these books.

43:22.300 --> 43:25.370
Clean officials bring peace;
corrupt officials bring suffering.

43:25.370 --> 43:28.020
The Empress Dowager and Emperor
bestow countless blessings,

43:28.020 --> 43:29.150
yet with great power

43:29.440 --> 43:31.300
comes both fortune and calamity.

43:31.490 --> 43:32.950
Though I am but a commoner,

43:33.400 --> 43:34.980
uninvolved in court politics,

43:34.980 --> 43:36.980
I too wish for peace and prosperity.

43:38.160 --> 43:39.530
My true gift

43:40.470 --> 43:41.800
is to do what little I can

43:42.230 --> 43:43.380
to remove corrupt officials

43:43.380 --> 43:45.980
[Impartial Justice]

43:44.070 --> 43:46.270
and preserve integrity in government.

43:51.800 --> 43:52.630
I have indeed

43:52.630 --> 43:54.490
underestimated the Rong family.

46:29.500 --> 46:31.850
[Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku]

46:35.070 --> 46:36.400
Is this book authentic?

46:37.280 --> 46:38.320
I got this

46:38.590 --> 46:40.030
from Wei Kejian before.

46:40.440 --> 46:42.040
It's absolutely authentic.

46:43.880 --> 46:45.000
"Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku"

46:44.760 --> 46:46.540
[Why is "Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku"
so precious?]

46:45.170 --> 46:47.000
is a large encyclopedia
from Southern Song Dynasty,

46:47.000 --> 46:49.070
equivalent to today's encyclopedia.

46:49.070 --> 46:50.400
The book contains

46:50.510 --> 46:51.360
astronomy, geography,

46:51.360 --> 46:53.320
poetry, health remedies,

46:53.580 --> 46:54.840
and even food stories.

46:55.510 --> 46:57.630
For example, Su Shi's Dongpo Pork

46:57.650 --> 46:59.450
might have first appeared here.

46:59.710 --> 47:01.550
It categorizes ancient wisdom

47:01.550 --> 47:03.150
into over a hundred volumes.

47:03.220 --> 47:05.350
Scholars can cite references from it.

47:05.630 --> 47:06.510
Common people

47:06.540 --> 47:08.270
can also learn some life hacks.

47:08.360 --> 47:09.550
Unfortunately, most of the original books

47:09.550 --> 47:10.920
have been lost.

47:11.150 --> 47:12.030
The remaining parts

47:12.030 --> 47:13.280
have become treasure maps

47:13.280 --> 47:14.330
for studying ancient culture.

47:14.330 --> 47:15.190
Even "Complete Tang Poems"

47:15.190 --> 47:16.190
relies on it to fill in the gaps.
